# API-client code written by `bun run generate-api-types` (openapi-generator-cli
# and openapi-typescript). Never hand-edited, and the generators do not format
# their output, so `prettier --check` fails on it the moment a job generates
# before it checks. Git ignores these paths too, but only through the per-package
# .gitignore files — and Prettier reads just the root .gitignore/.prettierignore
# relative to where it runs, so it never sees those. Listing them here is what
# actually exempts them.
packages/sdk/src/client/
packages/server/src/api.ts
packages/cli/src/api/generated/

